[node name="BathMirrorMagnifier" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Swing-arm magnifying mirror on a wall bracket. Origin = wall plane behind the pivot, at pivot height; front +Z. Folded flat along +X at 0 degrees; grab the head's rim and swing it out (0..170 degrees about the vertical pivot 40 mm off the wall, 90 = straight into the room); it stays where it's left."

